Search the game's item database by (localized) name substring. Pass `language` matching the language of the name the user gave (e.g. "en" or "zh") to search that localization; omit it to use the app's display language. Pass `kind` ("ship", "module", "charge", "drone", "fighter", "implant" or "booster") whenever the intended item kind is known to exclude unrelated matches. Returns up to 20 matches with `type_id`, `name`, `group_id`, and `category_id`; implants and boosters additionally carry `slot_index` (the implant/booster slot to pass to `apply_fit_edit`) and `slot_kind` ("implant" or "booster" — implants and boosters share category 20, so use `kind` to tell them apart). Use this to resolve an item the user mentions by name before reasoning about it; category 6 is ships, 7 modules, 8 charges, 18 drones, 20 implants/boosters, 87 fighters, 22 deployables.
